{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Percent Calculators 是一款專注於百分比運算的實用工具，適合學生、上班族與需要快速處理折扣、增幅或比例的人士。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，讓使用者以簡潔介面完成日常計算。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-142.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一站式百分比計算</h2>\n<p>開啟 Percent Calculators 後，可直接計算某數的百分比、兩個數值之間的百分比變化，以及一個數佔另一個數的百分比。它亦支援從數值中減去指定百分比，或把指定百分比加到數值上。介面以簡潔清晰為目標，操作直接，適合快速處理折扣、加價、成績比例與日常帳目等運算，減少手動換算步驟。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-62-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-63-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-64-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-65-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-66-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-67-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Percent Calculators</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/percent-calculators/id1566803300?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.291536+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T23:16:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:24.700822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.757169+00:00","content_hash":"35fbbf540f2954a9f9511a962d237ea36adc61c699a416e89a038303bbc6ba3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.291536+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}